{"seq":2,"slug":"car-t-cell-engineering","title":"博士转化医学 — CAR-T 细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/car-t-cell-engineering","wordCount":3292,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士转化医学-car-t-细胞工程\">博士转化医学 — CAR-T 细胞工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>嵌合抗原受体 T 细胞（CAR-T）疗法是将合成生物学与免疫学深度融合的典范，通过基因工程手段赋予患者自身 T 细胞精准识别并杀伤肿瘤细胞的能力。自 2017 年首款 CAR-T 产品获批以来，该领域经历了从血液肿瘤到实体瘤、从自体到通用型、从单靶点到多靶点逻辑门控的快速迭代。理解 CAR 分子的结构设计原理、制造工艺的关键质控节点、临床毒性的分级管理以及下一代技术方向，是转化医学博士研究者参与这一领域所必须掌握的核心知识体系。</p>\n<p><strong>核心概念速览：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CAR 结构</td>\n<td>scFv/VHH + 铰链 + 跨膜域 + 共刺激域 + CD3ζ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>靶点选择</td>\n<td>血液瘤（CD19, BCMA）vs 实体瘤（GD2, HER2, Claudin18.2）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制造流程</td>\n<td>白细胞单采 → 活化 → 转导 → 扩增 → QC → 回输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毒性管理</td>\n<td>CRS（Lee 分级）、ICANS、on-target off-tumor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下一代方向</td>\n<td>装甲型 CAR、逻辑门控 CAR、体内 CAR-T</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"car-分子结构的代际演化\">CAR 分子结构的代际演化</h3><p>CAR 的核心设计思想是将抗体的抗原识别能力与 T 细胞的效应功能整合于单一融合蛋白中。其结构演化反映了对 T 细胞信号传导理解的不断深入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;第一代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;scFv + CD3ζ&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第二代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;+ 1 共刺激域&lt;br/&gt;CD28 或 4-1BB&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;第三代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;+ 2 共刺激域&lt;br/&gt;CD28 + 4-1BB&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;第四代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;T-cell Redirected for&lt;br/&gt;Universal Cytokine Killing&lt;br/&gt;TRUCKs&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;第五代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;+ IL-2Rβ 片段&lt;br/&gt;激活 JAK-STAT&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"第一代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;scFv + CD3ζ\"] --&gt; B[\"第二代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;+ 1 共刺激域&lt;br/&gt;CD28 或 4-1BB\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"第三代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;+ 2 共刺激域&lt;br/&gt;CD28 + 4-1BB\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"第四代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;T-cell Redirected for&lt;br/&gt;Universal Cytokine Killing&lt;br/&gt;TRUCKs\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"第五代 CAR&lt;br/&gt;+ IL-2Rβ 片段&lt;br/&gt;激活 JAK-STAT\"]</pre><p><strong>各代 CAR 的结构与特点：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代际</th>\n<th>胞内信号域</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>临床表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一代</td>\n<td>CD3ζ</td>\n<td>仅提供信号 1（TCR 激活）</td>\n<td>体内扩增差，持久性不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二代</td>\n<td>CD28-CD3ζ 或 4-1BB-CD3ζ</td>\n<td>增加共刺激信号（信号 2）</td>\n<td>临床获批产品的主流设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三代</td>\n<td>CD28-4-1BB-CD3ζ</td>\n<td>双共刺激域串联</td>\n<td>信号过强可能导致耗竭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四代</td>\n<td>共刺激 + 诱导型细胞因子</td>\n<td>分泌 IL-12 等重塑微环境</td>\n<td>临床前/早期临床阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第五代</td>\n<td>共刺激 + IL-2Rβ 截短域</td>\n<td>激活内源 JAK-STAT3/5 通路</td>\n<td>模拟三信号激活模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二代 CAR 中，CD28 共刺激域倾向于产生快速、强效的效应 T 细胞反应，而 4-1BB 共刺激域则促进记忆 T 细胞分化与长期持久性。以数学形式表达 T 细胞激活的经典三信号模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>activation</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mtext>Signal 1</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mtext>CD3</mtext><mi>ζ</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>Signal 2</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>CD28/4-1BB</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>Signal 3</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Cytokines (IL-2, IL-12...)</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{activation}} = \\underbrace{\\text{Signal 1}}_{\\text{CD3}\\zeta} + \\underbrace{\\text{Signal 2}}_{\\text{CD28/4-1BB}} + \\underbrace{\\text{Signal 3}}_{\\text{Cytokines (IL-2, IL-12...)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">activation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3591em;vertical-align:-1.6647em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4715em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CD3</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">ζ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Signal 1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6647em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4369em;vertical-align:-1.7424em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4326em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CD28/4-1BB</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Signal 2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4369em;vertical-align:-1.7424em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4326em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Cytokines (IL-2, IL-12...)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Signal 3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CAR 的抗原识别域通常采用 scFv（单链可变片段），由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通过柔性接头（通常为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>S</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(G_4S)_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）连接。近年来，基于骆驼科动物的 VHH（纳米抗体）因其分子量小（~15 kDa vs scFv ~25 kDa）、稳定性高、可识别隐蔽表位等优势，正成为替代方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"靶抗原选择策略\">靶抗原选择策略</h3><p>理想的 CAR-T 靶抗原需满足以下标准：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>肿瘤特异性或高度限制性表达</strong> — 最小化 on-target off-tumor 毒性</li>\n<li><strong>均匀且稳定表达</strong> — 减少抗原逃逸风险</li>\n<li><strong>参与肿瘤生存的功能性作用</strong> — 降低抗原丢失的选择压力</li>\n<li><strong>胞外可及性</strong> — CAR 识别不依赖 MHC，但需要表面暴露的表位</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>已验证靶点与挑战：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>靶点</th>\n<th>适应症</th>\n<th>获批产品</th>\n<th>主要挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CD19</td>\n<td>B-ALL, DLBCL, FL</td>\n<td>Kymriah, Yescarta, Breyanzi, Tecartus</td>\n<td>B 细胞发育不全（可控）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BCMA</td>\n<td>多发性骨髓瘤</td>\n<td>Abecma, Carvykti</td>\n<td>可溶性 BCMA 竞争结合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CD22</td>\n<td>B-ALL（CD19 逃逸后）</td>\n<td>临床试验中</td>\n<td>表达密度阈值依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GD2</td>\n<td>神经母细胞瘤</td>\n<td>临床试验中</td>\n<td>神经毒性（小脑表达）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HER2</td>\n<td>多种实体瘤</td>\n<td>临床试验中</td>\n<td>心肺上皮低表达导致致命毒性案例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claudin18.2</td>\n<td>胃癌、胰腺癌</td>\n<td>临床试验中</td>\n<td>表达异质性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPC3</td>\n<td>肝细胞癌</td>\n<td>临床试验中</td>\n<td>肿瘤微环境免疫抑制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实体瘤靶抗原面临的核心困境是肿瘤相关抗原（TAA）与肿瘤特异性抗原（TSA/新抗原）之间的权衡：TAA 表达量高但缺乏特异性，新抗原高度特异但个体化且可能表达不均匀。</p>\n<h3 id=\"制造工艺全流程\">制造工艺全流程</h3><p>CAR-T 细胞的制造是一条将活细胞作为&quot;药物&quot;的精密生产线，涉及多个关键质控节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;白细胞单采&lt;br/&gt;Leukapheresis&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;T 细胞分选/富集&lt;br/&gt;CD3+ 或 CD4+/CD8+ 磁珠分选&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;T 细胞活化&lt;br/&gt;anti-CD3/CD28 磁珠&lt;br/&gt;或可溶性抗体&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;基因转导&lt;br/&gt;慢病毒/逆转录病毒载体&lt;br/&gt;或非病毒系统&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;体外扩增&lt;br/&gt;IL-2/IL-7/IL-15&lt;br/&gt;7-14 天&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;质量控制&lt;br/&gt;转导效率、细胞活力&lt;br/&gt;无菌检测、内毒素&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;冷冻保存&lt;br/&gt;-150°C 液氮&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;预处理化疗&lt;br/&gt;Flu/Cy 淋巴细胞清除&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;回输&lt;br/&gt;Infusion&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"白细胞单采&lt;br/&gt;Leukapheresis\"] --&gt; B[\"T 细胞分选/富集&lt;br/&gt;CD3+ 或 CD4+/CD8+ 磁珠分选\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"T 细胞活化&lt;br/&gt;anti-CD3/CD28 磁珠&lt;br/&gt;或可溶性抗体\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"基因转导&lt;br/&gt;慢病毒/逆转录病毒载体&lt;br/&gt;或非病毒系统\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"体外扩增&lt;br/&gt;IL-2/IL-7/IL-15&lt;br/&gt;7-14 天\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"质量控制&lt;br/&gt;转导效率、细胞活力&lt;br/&gt;无菌检测、内毒素\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"冷冻保存&lt;br/&gt;-150°C 液氮\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"预处理化疗&lt;br/&gt;Flu/Cy 淋巴细胞清除\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"回输&lt;br/&gt;Infusion\"]</pre><p><strong>关键工艺参数与质控指标：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工艺步骤</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>放行标准（典型值）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单采</td>\n<td>CD3+ 细胞收集量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1 \\times 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活化</td>\n<td>珠:细胞比</td>\n<td>通常 3:1 或 1:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转导</td>\n<td>MOI（感染复数）</td>\n<td>病毒载体依赖，通常 MOI 1-10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩增</td>\n<td>细胞倍增时间</td>\n<td>每 24-48 小时倍增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QC — 转导效率</td>\n<td>CAR+ 细胞比例</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>（多数产品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QC — 活力</td>\n<td>台盼蓝排斥</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QC — 无菌</td>\n<td>培养 14 天</td>\n<td>无微生物生长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QC — 内毒素</td>\n<td>LAL 法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mtext> EU/mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 3.5 \\text{ EU/mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> EU/mL</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QC — RCL</td>\n<td>复制型病毒检测</td>\n<td>阴性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回输剂量</td>\n<td>CAR+ T 细胞数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.2 - 5 \\times 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（产品依赖）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>转导技术比较：</strong></p>\n<p>病毒载体（慢病毒 LV、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>-逆转录病毒 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>RV）仍是临床主流，但非病毒方法正在兴起：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sleeping Beauty / piggyBac 转座子</strong> — 成本低，载荷容量大（&gt;10 kb），但整合位点随机性与病毒类似</li>\n<li><strong>CRISPR 定点敲入</strong> — 可实现 CAR 定向整合至 TRAC 位点（内源 TCR <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 链），同时敲除内源 TCR，一举两得</li>\n<li><strong>mRNA 电转</strong> — 瞬时表达，安全性高，适用于需要自限性 CAR 表达的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"自体-vs-通用型-同种异体-策略\">自体 vs 通用型（同种异体）策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>自体 CAR-T</th>\n<th>通用型 CAR-T</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细胞来源</td>\n<td>患者自身 T 细胞</td>\n<td>健康供体或 iPSC 来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制造周期</td>\n<td>3-5 周</td>\n<td>现货供应（off-the-shelf）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GvHD 风险</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需敲除内源 TCR（TRAC KO）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宿主排斥</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需敲除 HLA-I（B2M KO）或引入 HLA-E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T 细胞质量</td>\n<td>受既往治疗影响</td>\n<td>可标准化筛选优质供体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>高（个体化制造）</td>\n<td>潜在降低（批量制造）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久性</td>\n<td>长（免疫兼容）</td>\n<td>短（宿主免疫清除）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表项目</td>\n<td>Kymriah, Yescarta</td>\n<td>UCART19, ALLO-501, FT819</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>通用型 CAR-T 的核心基因编辑策略通常采用多重 CRISPR 敲除：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Allo-CAR-T</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>CAR</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>TRAC</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>B2M</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msup><mo>±</mo><msup><mtext>CD52</mtext><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Allo-CAR-T} = \\text{CAR}^{+} + \\text{TRAC}^{-/-} + \\text{B2M}^{-/-} \\pm \\text{CD52}^{-/-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Allo-CAR-T</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0446em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TRAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9612em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0446em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B2M</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9612em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9612em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CD52</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9612em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 TRAC 敲除消除 GvHD，B2M 敲除减少宿主 T 细胞识别，CD52 敲除允许使用阿仑单抗进行选择性淋巴清除而不影响 CAR-T 细胞。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实体瘤微环境挑战\">实体瘤微环境挑战</h3><p>CAR-T 在实体瘤中的疗效远不及血液瘤，核心障碍可归纳为三大维度：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 运输与浸润（Trafficking）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>实体瘤缺乏将 T 细胞导向肿瘤的趋化因子梯度</li>\n<li>异常肿瘤血管系统阻碍 T 细胞外渗</li>\n<li>致密的细胞外基质形成物理屏障</li>\n<li>策略：工程化表达趋化因子受体（如 CCR2b 靶向 CCL2 梯度）、局部注射、共表达肝素酶降解基质</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 免疫抑制微环境（Immunosuppression）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>抑制性细胞：Treg、MDSC、M2 巨噬细胞</li>\n<li>抑制性分子：PD-L1、TGF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、IL-10、IDO、腺苷</li>\n<li>代谢竞争：低氧、低 pH、营养耗竭（精氨酸、色氨酸）</li>\n<li>策略：PD-1 阻断型 CAR（分泌 anti-PD-1 scFv）、显性负性 TGF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 受体、腺苷 A2aR 敲除</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 持久性与耗竭（Persistence &amp; Exhaustion）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>持续抗原刺激导致 T 细胞耗竭（TOX、NR4A 转录因子上调）</li>\n<li>效应功能进行性丧失：细胞因子分泌减少、杀伤力下降</li>\n<li>策略：c-Jun 过表达抵抗耗竭程序、4-1BB 共刺激域偏向记忆分化、IL-15 自分泌回路</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"毒性管理\">毒性管理</h3><p><strong>细胞因子释放综合征（CRS）— Lee 分级标准：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分级</th>\n<th>临床表现</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 级</td>\n<td>发热（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>38</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\geq 38°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>），无低血压/低氧</td>\n<td>对症退热，密切监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 级</td>\n<td>需低流量吸氧（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> L/min）或低血压对液体复苏有反应</td>\n<td>考虑 Tocilizumab</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 级</td>\n<td>需高流量吸氧（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> L/min）或升压药维持血压</td>\n<td>Tocilizumab + 糖皮质激素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 级</td>\n<td>需机械通气和/或多种升压药</td>\n<td>ICU 管理，大剂量激素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tocilizumab（抗 IL-6R 单抗）是 CRS 的一线治疗，其作用机制为阻断 IL-6 信号通路。值得注意的是，IL-6 在 CRS 中的来源主要是单核/巨噬细胞而非 CAR-T 细胞本身。</p>\n<p><strong>免疫效应细胞相关神经毒性综合征（ICANS）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>机制尚未完全阐明，可能涉及内皮激活、血脑屏障通透性增加、IL-1/IL-6 中枢作用</li>\n<li>评估工具：ICE（免疫效应细胞脑病）评分，满分 10 分</li>\n<li>管理：糖皮质激素为主，地塞米松 10 mg IV q6h；严重者（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 级）大剂量甲泼尼龙</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>On-target Off-tumor 毒性：</strong></p>\n<p>当靶抗原在正常组织低水平表达时，CAR-T 可能攻击正常组织。经典案例包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CD19 CAR-T → B 细胞发育不全（可通过 IVIG 替代管理）</li>\n<li>HER2 CAR-T → 心肺毒性（2010 年致死案例，提示剂量和亲和力调控的重要性）</li>\n<li>低亲和力 CAR 设计：通过降低 scFv 亲和力（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>D</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 nM 提高至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>M 范围），使 CAR-T 仅识别高密度表达靶抗原的肿瘤细胞，而放过低密度表达的正常组织</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"下一代-car-t-技术\">下一代 CAR-T 技术</h3><p><strong>装甲型 CAR（Armored CARs / TRUCKs）：</strong></p>\n<p>CAR-T 细胞被工程化为同时分泌细胞因子（IL-12, IL-15, IL-18）或检查点阻断性 scFv，在肿瘤局部重塑免疫微环境。这种&quot;第四代&quot;设计将 CAR-T 从单纯的杀伤细胞升级为免疫微环境调节器。</p>\n<p><strong>逻辑门控 CAR（Logic-Gated CARs）：</strong></p>\n<p>为提高靶向特异性，引入布尔逻辑概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AND 门</strong> — synNotch 系统：抗原 A 激活 synNotch 受体 → 转录激活 CAR 表达 → 仅在抗原 A+B 双阳性细胞上激活杀伤</li>\n<li><strong>OR 门</strong> — 双靶点 CAR 或串联 CAR（TanCAR）：识别抗原 A 或 B 均可激活，减少单抗原逃逸</li>\n<li><strong>NOT 门</strong> — 抑制性 CAR（iCAR）：识别正常组织标志物时传递 PD-1/CTLA-4 抑制信号，保护正常组织</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>体内 CAR-T（In Vivo CAR-T）：</strong></p>\n<p>跳过体外制造流程，直接在体内将患者 T 细胞转化为 CAR-T：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LNP 递送 mRNA</strong> — 靶向 T 细胞的脂质纳米颗粒（anti-CD5 LNP），注射后体内生成瞬时 CAR-T</li>\n<li><strong>慢病毒体内转导</strong> — 表面工程化的慢病毒颗粒特异性感染 T 细胞</li>\n<li>优势：消除体外制造成本与周期，潜在实现&quot;现货型&quot;CAR-T</li>\n<li>挑战：转导效率、脱靶转导风险、CAR 表达持久性控制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>结构设计题</strong>：如果你需要设计一款靶向 Claudin18.2 的实体瘤 CAR-T，你会选择 CD28 还是 4-1BB 作为共刺激域？请从效应功能、持久性和耗竭风险三个维度进行分析，并说明理由。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>工艺优化题</strong>：某批次 CAR-T 产品在 QC 检测中发现转导效率仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span></span></span></span></span>（放行标准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>），请列出至少三种可能的原因及相应的工艺优化方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>毒性管理题</strong>：一位接受 CD19 CAR-T 回输的 B-ALL 患者在回输后第 3 天出现持续高热（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>39.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">39.5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39.5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）、低血压（需去甲肾上腺素维持）和低氧血症（需面罩吸氧 8 L/min）。请按 Lee 分级标准判断 CRS 等级，并制定详细的处理方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>前沿思考题</strong>：比较 synNotch AND 门控系统与串联 CAR（TanCAR）在实体瘤治疗中的优缺点。哪种策略更适合抗原表达高度异质性的肿瘤？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>转化视角题</strong>：从制造成本、可及性和临床疗效三个维度，论述体内 CAR-T 技术如果成功，将如何改变当前 CAR-T 治疗的产业格局。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>经典综述</strong>：June CH, Sadelain M. &quot;Chimeric Antigen Receptor Therapy.&quot; <em>NEJM</em> 2018;379:64-73 — CAR-T 领域的里程碑式综述</li>\n<li><strong>CAR 结构工程</strong>：Majzner RG, Mackall CL. &quot;Tumor Antigen Escape from CAR T-cell Therapy.&quot; <em>Cancer Discovery</em> 2018;8(10):1219-1226</li>\n<li><strong>CRS 管理指南</strong>：Lee DW et al. &quot;ASTCT Consensus Grading for CRS and Neurologic Toxicity.&quot; <em>Biology of Blood and Marrow Transplantation</em> 2019;25(4):625-638</li>\n<li><strong>实体瘤挑战</strong>：Rafiq S, Hackett CS, Brentjens RJ. &quot;Engineering strategies to overcome the current roadblocks in CAR T cell therapy.&quot; <em>Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology</em> 2020;17:147-167</li>\n<li><strong>体内 CAR-T</strong>：Rurik JG et al. &quot;CAR T cells produced in vivo to treat cardiac injury.&quot; <em>Science</em> 2022;375(6576):91-96 — 首次证明 LNP 介导的体内 CAR-T 可行性</li>\n<li><strong>通用型 CAR-T</strong>：关注 Allogene Therapeutics（ALLO 系列）、Fate Therapeutics（iPSC 来源 FT 系列）的临床进展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CAR-T 细胞工程是合成免疫学与转化医学交汇的前沿阵地。本文系统梳理了五个核心维度：（1）CAR 结构从第一代到第五代的演化逻辑，核心在于逐步还原 T 细胞活化的完整信号模型；（2）靶抗原选择的理想标准与临床现实之间的张力，尤其是实体瘤靶点面临的特异性-覆盖度悖论；（3）细胞制造全流程的关键质控节点，活细胞作为药物所带来的独特 CMC 挑战；（4）CRS 与 ICANS 的分级管理以及 on-target off-tumor 毒性的亲和力调控策略；（5）装甲型 CAR、逻辑门控和体内 CAR-T 等下一代技术方向。作为博士研究者，应始终以&quot;从实验室到临床&quot;的转化视角审视每一项技术创新，关注其临床可行性、可制造性和可商业化潜力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士转化医学 — CAR-T 细胞工程","id":"博士转化医学-car-t-细胞工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"CAR 分子结构的代际演化","id":"car-分子结构的代际演化"},{"level":3,"text":"靶抗原选择策略","id":"靶抗原选择策略"},{"level":3,"text":"制造工艺全流程","id":"制造工艺全流程"},{"level":3,"text":"自体 vs 通用型（同种异体）策略","id":"自体-vs-通用型-同种异体-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"实体瘤微环境挑战","id":"实体瘤微环境挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"毒性管理","id":"毒性管理"},{"level":3,"text":"下一代 CAR-T 技术","id":"下一代-car-t-技术"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 基因治疗载体工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/gene-therapy-vectors"},"next":{"title":"博士转化医学 — CRISPR 基因组编辑治疗","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/crispr-genome-editing"}}